<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1">
  <title>Elegant Events | Plan Your Perfect Day</title>
  <style>
    /* Reset and base styles */
    * {
      margin: 0;
      padding: 0;
      box-sizing: border-box;
    }

    body {
      font-family: 'Poppins', sans-serif;
      line-height: 1.6;
    }

    /* Navigation styles */
    nav {
      position: fixed;
      top: 0;
      width: 100%;
      background-color: transparent;
      display: flex;
      justify-content: space-between;
      align-items: center;
      padding: 15px 30px;
      transition: all 0.4s ease;
      z-index: 1000;
    }

    nav.scrolled {
      background-color: #1a1a1a;
      box-shadow: 0 4px 6px rgba(0,0,0,0.3);
    }

    .logo {
      font-size: 2rem;
      font-weight: bold;
      color: #ffffff;
      letter-spacing: 2px;
    }

    .nav-links {
      list-style: none;
      display: flex;
    }

    .nav-links li {
      margin-left: 25px;
    }

    .nav-links a {
      text-decoration: none;
      color: white;
      font-size: 1.1rem;
      transition: color 0.3s ease, border-bottom 0.3s ease;
    }

    .nav-links a:hover {
      color: #ff6b6b;
      border-bottom: 2px solid #ff6b6b;
    }

    /* Section styles */
    .section {
      padding: 120px 20px;
      min-height: 100vh;
      background: linear-gradient(135deg, #f3f3f3 0%, #e2e2e2 100%);
      display: flex;
      flex-direction: column;
      justify-content: center;
      align-items: center;
      text-align: center;
    }

    .section h1 {
      font-size: 3rem;
      margin-bottom: 20px;
    }

    .section p {
      font-size: 1.3rem;
      max-width: 800px;
    }

    #home {
      background: linear-gradient(135deg, #ff6b6b 0%, #f06595 100%);
      color: white;
    }

    #services {
      background: linear-gradient(135deg, #ff7e5f 0%, #feb47b 100%);
      color: white;
    }

    #gallery {
      background: linear-gradient(135deg, #6a11cb 0%, #2575fc 100%);
      color: white;
      padding-bottom: 60px;
    }

    #contact {
      background: linear-gradient(135deg, #11998e 0%, #38ef7d 100%);
      color: white;
    }

    /* Gallery styles */
    .gallery-container {
      display: flex;
      flex-wrap: wrap;
      justify-content: center;
      margin-top: 30px;
      gap: 20px;
    }

    .gallery-container img {
      width: 300px;
      height: 200px;
      object-fit: cover;
      border-radius: 10px;
      box-shadow: 0 4px 8px rgba(0,0,0,0.3);
      transition: transform 0.3s;
    }

    .gallery-container img:hover {
      transform: scale(1.05);
    }
  </style>
</head>
<body>

  <!-- Fixed Navigation Menu -->
  <nav id="navbar">
    <div class="logo">Elegant Events</div>
    <ul class="nav-links">
      <li><a href="#home">Home</a></li>
      <li><a href="#services">Services</a></li>
      <li><a href="#gallery">Gallery</a></li>
      <li><a href="#contact">Contact</a></li>
    </ul>
  </nav>

  <!-- Page Content -->
  <section id="home" class="section">
    <h1>Plan Your Perfect Day</h1>
    <p>Elegant Events brings your dreams to life — weddings, birthdays, corporate events, and more!</p>
  </section>

  <section id="services" class="section">
    <h1>Our Services</h1>
    <p>We offer full-service event planning: Weddings, Birthday Parties, Corporate Events, Product Launches, and Customized Decor. Let's design your dream event together!</p>
  </section>

  <section id="gallery" class="section">
    <h1>Gallery</h1>
    <div class="gallery-container">
      <img src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1524995997946-a1c2e315a42f" alt="Wedding Event">
      <img src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1531058020387-3be344556be6" alt="Birthday Celebration">
      <img src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1567016548408-9022b2d56c4b" alt="Corporate Event">
      <img src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1587829741301-dc798b83add3" alt="Party Setup">
      <img src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1565120130291-37c7e5d0a5f4" alt="Outdoor Event">
    </div>
  </section>

  <section id="contact" class="section">
    <h1>Contact Us</h1>
    <p>Ready to plan your event? Reach out to us today and let's start the magic!</p>
    <p style="margin-top: 20px; font-size: 1.2rem;">
      📞 <strong>Phone:</strong> <a href="tel:+916379126127" style="color: white; text-decoration: underline;">+91 6379126127</a><br>
      📧 <strong>Email:</strong> <a href="mailto:abinayarajendran944@gmail.com" style="color: white; text-decoration: underline;">abinayarajendran944@gmail.com</a>
    </p>
  </section>

  <script>
    // Change navbar style on scroll
    window.addEventListener('scroll', function() {
      const navbar = document.getElementById('navbar');
      if (window.scrollY > 50) {
        navbar.classList.add('scrolled');
      } else {
        navbar.classList.remove('scrolled');
      }
    });
  </script>
</body>
</html>

  
